1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,760
Good evening, and welcome to this
guide to the Riverside Summer Festival.

2
00:00:05,099 --> 00:00:08,520
Things get going on Friday with
the opening parade down Main Street.

3
00:00:08,964 --> 00:00:11,440
Watching is free, and
the parade finishes with

4
00:00:11,464 --> 00:00:13,952
fireworks over the
river, so do stay until the

5
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:17,759
end. Saturday is Food
Fair Day! This year it's

6
00:00:17,783 --> 00:00:21,893
in Elm Park, E-L-M, rather
than down on the Riverside.

7
00:00:21,894 --> 00:00:24,241
Entry is $5, which
is a bargain when

8
00:00:24,265 --> 00:00:27,520
you see more than 40
stalls. On Saturday evening,

9
00:00:27,521 --> 00:00:30,290
there's jazz at the
bandstand down by the river.

10
00:00:30,314 --> 00:00:33,212
Tickets are $15, and there
are only a few benches,

11
00:00:33,499 --> 00:00:35,568
so bring a chair if you
don't want to stand.

12
00:00:35,592 --> 00:00:38,087
On Sunday morning, the
craft workshops will be in the

13
00:00:38,088 --> 00:00:40,791
library, as the community
hall is being repaired.

14
00:00:40,815 --> 00:00:43,367
There's no charge, but
numbers are limited, so

15
00:00:43,368 --> 00:00:46,177
you'll need to book in
advance. Sunday afternoon

16
00:00:46,201 --> 00:00:48,395
brings the Dog
Show, back in Elm Park.

17
00:00:48,396 --> 00:00:52,592
It costs $3 to enter your dog,
and there are no cash prizes.

18
00:00:52,616 --> 00:00:55,791
The winners get a
trophy. Now, getting here.

19
00:00:55,792 --> 00:00:59,148
Shuttle buses run from
the train station, not the bus

20
00:00:59,172 --> 00:01:02,007
station, every 20
minutes. A ticket costs $2,

21
00:01:02,008 --> 00:01:04,600
and children ride free.
The town centre will be

22
00:01:04,624 --> 00:01:07,802
closed to traffic, so drivers
should park at the stadium.

23
00:01:07,803 --> 00:01:10,286
It's $10 for the
day. If you're cycling,

24
00:01:10,310 --> 00:01:13,051
there's free bike
parking beside the bridge.

25
00:01:13,052 --> 00:01:15,855
If you lose something,
head to the information tent.

26
00:01:15,879 --> 00:01:18,294
The first aid post is
next to the main stage.

27
00:01:18,295 --> 00:01:21,847
And if you need help, our
volunteers are wearing green t-shirts.

28
00:01:21,871 --> 00:01:25,127
Security staff are in yellow.
We hope you have a wonderful

29
00:01:25,128 --> 00:01:27,360
time at this year's
Riverside Summer Festival.

